---
import Layout from '../../layouts/RealestateLayout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Buy a Home in Toronto and the GTA | Cory Wong, Real Estate Agent | Trustwell Realty"
  description="Looking to buy in Toronto, Markham, or Richmond Hill? Cory Wong provides buyer representation, MLS access, and guidance from search to close. Free consultation."
  canonicalPath="/buy"
>
  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-hero__title">Buy in the GTA</h1>
      <p class="page-hero__subtitle">
        Whether you're a first-time buyer or a seasoned investor, I help you find and secure
        the right property in Toronto, Markham, Richmond Hill, and across the Greater Toronto Area.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What Cory Provides -->
  <section class="buyer-services">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="section-heading">What Cory Provides</h2>
      <ul class="service-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Buyer consultation</strong> &mdash; a free, no-obligation meeting to understand your
          goals, budget, and timeline before we begin.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Full MLS access</strong> &mdash; real-time listings across Toronto, Markham,
          Richmond Hill, and the broader GTA so you see every available property.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Showings and previews</strong> &mdash; I coordinate and attend showings on your
          schedule, providing honest assessments of each property.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Offer preparation and negotiation</strong> &mdash; competitive offers backed by a
          comparative market analysis (CMA), with skilled negotiation to protect your interests.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Transaction coordination</strong> &mdash; I manage inspections, financing conditions,
          lawyer coordination, and every detail through to closing.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Guidance from search to close</strong> &mdash; clear communication at every stage
          so you always know what's happening and what comes next.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <div class="buyer-note">
        <p>
          <strong>Buyer agent services cost you nothing.</strong> In most transactions, the seller's
          brokerage covers the compensation for both the listing and buyer agents. You get full
          representation at no direct cost.
        </p>
        <p>
          In addition to Toronto, Markham, and Richmond Hill, I also serve buyers across
          Peel, York, and Durham regions.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The GTA Buying Process -->
  <section class="process">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="section-heading">The GTA Buying Process</h2>
      <ol class="process-steps">
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">1</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>Get Pre-Approved</h3>
            <p>
              Speak with a mortgage broker or lender to confirm your budget. A pre-approval letter
              strengthens your offers and clarifies your price range. Ask about the First Home Savings
              Account (FHSA) if you're a first-time buyer — it offers tax-free savings toward your
              down payment.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">2</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>Define Your Criteria</h3>
            <p>
              We discuss your must-haves, nice-to-haves, preferred neighbourhoods, property type,
              and timeline. This focused search saves time and ensures we're looking at properties
              that truly fit.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">3</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>Search and Showings</h3>
            <p>
              I set up automated MLS alerts based on your criteria and schedule showings at your
              convenience. After each visit, we debrief so I can refine the search as your preferences
              evolve.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">4</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>Make an Offer</h3>
            <p>
              When you find the right property, I prepare a competitive offer informed by a
              comparative market analysis (CMA). I negotiate on your behalf to secure the best
              possible price and terms.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">5</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>Due Diligence</h3>
            <p>
              Once your offer is accepted, we move through conditions: home inspection, status
              certificate review (for condos), and financing confirmation. I coordinate with
              inspectors, lawyers, and your lender to keep everything on track.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="process-step">
          <span class="process-step__number">6</span>
          <div class="process-step__content">
            <h3>Close</h3>
            <p>
              Your lawyer handles the final paperwork and title transfer. Budget for closing costs
              of approximately 1.5&ndash;3% of the purchase price, which includes land transfer tax,
              legal fees, title insurance, and adjustments. Then you get the keys.
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section class="faq">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Do I need a buyer's agent?</summary>
        <p>
          You are not required to have a buyer's agent, but working with one gives you dedicated
          representation, access to market data and a CMA, skilled negotiation, and someone who
          manages the transaction details on your behalf. In most cases, the seller's brokerage
          covers the buyer agent's compensation, so there is no direct cost to you.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>How long does buying take?</summary>
        <p>
          From the time you start actively searching to closing, the typical timeline in the GTA
          is 2 to 6 months. Factors include your price range, how competitive the market is in your
          target neighbourhoods, and financing timelines. A pre-approval speeds things up considerably.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What is the stress test?</summary>
        <p>
          The mortgage stress test is a federal requirement that ensures you can afford your mortgage
          at a higher interest rate than your actual rate. You must qualify at either the Bank of
          Canada's benchmark rate or your contract rate plus 2%, whichever is greater. This applies
          to all buyers, regardless of down payment size.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Should I buy before selling?</summary>
        <p>
          It depends on your financial situation and risk tolerance. Buying first gives you time to
          find the right home without pressure but requires bridge financing or carrying two
          properties. Selling first provides certainty on proceeds but may require temporary
          housing. I help you evaluate both approaches and choose the one that fits your circumstances.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>What is a buyer representation agreement?</summary>
        <p>
          Under the Trust in Real Estate Services Act (TRESA), which replaced REBBA, a buyer
          representation agreement (BRA) formalizes the relationship between you and your agent.
          It outlines the services you'll receive, the geographic area and property types covered,
          the duration of the agreement, and compensation details. I walk you through every clause
          before you sign.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Do you work with new construction?</summary>
        <p>
          Yes. I represent buyers purchasing pre-construction condos and new-build homes. Builder
          contracts have unique terms — including deposit structures, assignment clauses, and
          occupancy fees — that benefit from experienced representation.
        </p>
      </details>

      <details class="faq-item">
        <summary>Do you cover areas outside Toronto?</summary>
        <p>
          Yes. In addition to Toronto, Markham, and Richmond Hill, I serve buyers across Peel Region
          (Mississauga, Brampton, Caledon), York Region (Vaughan, Newmarket, Aurora), and Durham
          Region (Oshawa, Whitby, Ajax, Pickering).
        </p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Lead Form -->
  <section class="inquiry" id="inquiry">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="section-heading">Tell Me What You're Looking For</h2>
      <form id="buyer-form" class="lead-form" novalidate>
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="buyer-name">Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="buyer-name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" />
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="buyer-email">Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="buyer-email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" />
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-row">
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="buyer-budget">Budget</label>
            <select id="buyer-budget" name="budget">
              <option value="">Select a range</option>
              <option value="Under $500K">Under $500K</option>
              <option value="$500-750K">$500&ndash;750K</option>
              <option value="$750K-1M">$750K&ndash;1M</option>
              <option value="$1M-1.5M">$1M&ndash;1.5M</option>
              <option value="$1.5M+">$1.5M+</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="buyer-timeline">Timeline</label>
            <select id="buyer-timeline" name="timeline">
              <option value="">Select a timeline</option>
              <option value="ASAP">ASAP</option>
              <option value="1-3 months">1&ndash;3 months</option>
              <option value="3-6 months">3&ndash;6 months</option>
              <option value="6-12 months">6&ndash;12 months</option>
              <option value="Just exploring">Just exploring</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="buyer-neighbourhoods">Preferred neighbourhoods</label>
          <input type="text" id="buyer-neighbourhoods" name="neighbourhoods" placeholder="e.g. Markham, Unionville, North York" />
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
          <label for="buyer-notes">Notes</label>
          <textarea id="buyer-notes" name="notes" rows="4" placeholder="Anything else I should know — property type, features, questions..."></textarea>
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="cta cta--primary form-submit">Send Inquiry</button>
        <p id="buyer-form-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Banner -->
  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="cta-banner__title">Ready to Start Your Search?</h2>
      <p class="cta-banner__text">
        Book a free consultation and let's talk about what you're looking for.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="cta cta--primary">Book a Consultation</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Newsletter Signup -->
  <section class="newsletter">
    <div class="container content-narrow">
      <h2 class="newsletter__heading">Get the GTA Market Report Each Month</h2>
      <p class="newsletter__text">
        Stay informed with monthly market data, neighbourhood insights, and practical advice
        for buyers and sellers across the Greater Toronto Area.
      </p>
      <form id="newsletter-form" class="newsletter__form" novalidate>
        <input
          type="email"
          id="newsletter-email"
          name="email"
          placeholder="you@example.com"
          required
          autocomplete="email"
          class="newsletter__input"
        />
        <button type="submit" class="cta cta--primary newsletter__btn">Subscribe</button>
      </form>
      <p id="newsletter-form-status" class="form-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  // Buyer inquiry form
  const buyerForm = document.getElementById('buyer-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const buyerStatus = document.getElementById('buyer-form-status');

  if (buyerForm && buyerStatus) {
    buyerForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      buyerStatus.textContent = '';
      buyerStatus.className = 'form-status';

      const formData = new FormData(buyerForm);
      const payload = {
        type: 'buyer',
        name: formData.get('name'),
        email: formData.get('email'),
        budget: formData.get('budget'),
        timeline: formData.get('timeline'),
        neighbourhoods: formData.get('neighbourhoods'),
        notes: formData.get('notes'),
      };

      try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/lead', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          buyerStatus.textContent = 'Thank you! I\'ll be in touch within one business day.';
          buyerStatus.classList.add('form-status--success');
          buyerForm.reset();
        } else {
          throw new Error('Request failed');
        }
      } catch {
        buyerStatus.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again or email me directly.';
        buyerStatus.classList.add('form-status--error');
      }
    });
  }

  // Newsletter form
  const newsletterForm = document.getElementById('newsletter-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const newsletterStatus = document.getElementById('newsletter-form-status');

  if (newsletterForm && newsletterStatus) {
    newsletterForm.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
      e.preventDefault();
      newsletterStatus.textContent = '';
      newsletterStatus.className = 'form-status';

      const formData = new FormData(newsletterForm);
      const payload = {
        type: 'newsletter',
        email: formData.get('email'),
      };

      try {
        const res = await fetch('/api/lead', {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify(payload),
        });

        if (res.ok) {
          newsletterStatus.textContent = 'You\'re subscribed! Watch your inbox for the next report.';
          newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--success');
          newsletterForm.reset();
        } else {
          throw new Error('Request failed');
        }
      } catch {
        newsletterStatus.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again.';
        newsletterStatus.classList.add('form-status--error');
      }
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  /* Content width */
  .content-narrow {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* Page Hero */
  .page-hero {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-xl);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .page-hero__title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .page-hero__subtitle {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Section Heading */
  .section-heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  /* Buyer Services */
  .buyer-services {
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0 var(--space-2xl);
  }

  .service-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .service-list li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    padding-left: var(--space-lg);
    position: relative;
  }

  .service-list li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.55em;
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .service-list li strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .buyer-note {
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
    padding: var(--space-lg);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .buyer-note p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .buyer-note p + p {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
  }

  .buyer-note strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  /* Process Steps */
  .process {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    background: #f5f5f4;
  }

  .process-steps {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .process-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .process-step__number {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 2.25rem;
    height: 2.25rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .process-step__content h3 {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .process-step__content p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* FAQ */
  .faq {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
  }

  .faq-item {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .faq-item summary {
    padding: var(--space-md) 0;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .faq-item summary::after {
    content: '+';
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-left: var(--space-md);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease;
  }

  .faq-item[open] summary::after {
    content: '\2212';
  }

  .faq-item p {
    padding: 0 0 var(--space-md);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  /* Inquiry Form */
  .inquiry {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    background: #f5f5f4;
  }

  .lead-form {
    max-width: 32rem;
  }

  .form-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .form-group label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .form-group input,
  .form-group select,
  .form-group textarea {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    color: var(--color-text);
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .form-group input:focus,
  .form-group select:focus,
  .form-group textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(15, 118, 110, 0.1);
  }

  .form-group textarea {
    resize: vertical;
  }

  .form-submit {
    border: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .form-status {
    margin-top: var(--space-md);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    min-height: 1.25rem;
  }

  .form-status--success {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .form-status--error {
    color: #b91c1c;
  }

  /* CTA Buttons */
  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .cta--primary {
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .cta--primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* CTA Banner */
  .cta-banner {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .cta-banner__title {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }

  .cta-banner__text {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  }

  /* Newsletter */
  .newsletter {
    padding: var(--space-2xl) 0;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #ffffff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .newsletter__heading {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__text {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    opacity: 0.9;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .newsletter__form {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    max-width: 28rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .newsletter__input {
    flex: 1;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 0.625rem 0.75rem;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .newsletter__input::placeholder {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .newsletter__input:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #ffffff;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  .newsletter__btn {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border: 1px solid #ffffff;
    background: #ffffff;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .newsletter__btn:hover {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--success {
    color: #ffffff;
    opacity: 0.9;
  }

  .newsletter .form-status--error {
    color: #fecaca;
  }

  /* Responsive */
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .form-row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .newsletter__form {
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }
</style>
